## Upstream attribution

GameDepot is a derivative work of Drop OSS (https://github.com/Drop-OSS/drop),
which is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

The following are carried over from Drop OSS and remain under AGPL-3.0-only:

- The database schema, including its models, enums and indexes.
- The desktop client Rust core under `desktop/src-tauri/`.
- The `libraries/droplet` crate and its manifest and certificate formats.
- The droplet v2 and `gamedepot-droplet` depot formats.
- The client HTTP contract and WebSocket protocol.
- Portions of documentation and naming reused or adapted.

